<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0c">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Fandez Admin">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <link rel="manifest" href="<%= adminBase %>/app.webmanifest">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/fandez-admin-180.png?v=1">
  <link rel="icon" href="/icons/fandez-admin-192.png?v=1">
  <title>Fandez Admin</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0c;
      --card: #151518;
      --line: #2a2a30;
      --text: #f4f4f5;
      --muted: #a1a1aa;
      --amber: #c45c14;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --ok: #22c55e;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "SF Pro Text", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(10,10,12,.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 12px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top));
      padding-top: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    header img { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px; }
    header h1 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    header p { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
    .actions { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    button, .btn {
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #222228;
    }
    .btn-amber { background: var(--amber); color: #fff; }
    main { padding: 14px 14px 100px; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .stat {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stat strong { display: block; font-size: 18px; color: var(--amber); }
    .stat span { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }
    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .card.critical { border-color: #7f1d1d; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--danger); }
    .card.resolved { opacity: 0.55; }
    .meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    .body {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #d4d4d8;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      line-height: 1.4;
      max-height: 9em;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .empty { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); padding: 40px 10px; font-size: 14px; }
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 24px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: #18181b;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: none;
      z-index: 50;
    }
    .install-hint {
      background: #1a120c;
      border: 1px solid #3f2a1a;
      color: #fbbf8a;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <img src="/icons/fandez-admin-192.png?v=1" alt="Fandez Admin">
    <div>
      <h1>Fandez Admin</h1>
      <p>Alertas de agentes · privado</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button type="button" id="btnPush" class="btn-amber">Activar avisos</button>
      <a class="btn" href="<%= adminBase %>">Panel</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="install-hint" id="installHint">
      En Chrome/Android: menú ⋮ → <strong>Instalar app</strong> / Añadir a inicio.
      Queda como “Fandez Admin” (ícono negro). No está en Google Play.
    </div>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><strong id="statOpen">—</strong><span>Abiertas</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong id="statCrit">—</strong><span>Críticas</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong id="statToday">—</strong><span>Hoy</span></div>
    </div>

    <div id="list"></div>
    <div class="empty" id="empty" hidden>Sin alertas abiertas. Sofía / Clara te avisarán aquí y por correo.</div>
  </main>

  <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

  <script>
    window.FandezAdminBase = <%- JSON.stringify(adminBase) %>;
    window.FandezCsrf = <%- JSON.stringify(csrfToken || '') %>;
  </script>
  <script src="/js/notify.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/admin-ops-app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
